#!/bin/sh
# Giochi Konsol OS v1.2 — hotplug de dongle USB (S11, secao 1.4).
# Uso (mdev): giochi-dongle-hotplug <ACTION> <DEVPATH>
set -u

ACTION=${1:-}
DEVPATH=${2:-}
TAG=giochi-dongle
DETECT_TIMEOUT_MS=3000

log() { logger -t "$TAG" -- "$*" 2>/dev/null || echo "$TAG: $*" >&2; }

[ "$ACTION" = "add" ] || exit 0
[ -n "$DEVPATH" ] || exit 0

vid=$(cat "/sys$DEVPATH/idVendor" 2>/dev/null) || exit 0
pid=$(cat "/sys$DEVPATH/idProduct" 2>/dev/null) || exit 0
[ -n "$vid" ] && [ -n "$pid" ] || exit 0
vidpid=$(echo "$vid:$pid" | tr 'A-Z' 'a-z')

case "$vidpid" in
    0bda:8179) mod=8188eu ;;
    0bda:8176) mod=rtl8192cu ;;
    0bda:8812|0bda:881a) mod=8812au ;;
    0b50:7601) mod=mt7601u ;;
    0cf3:9271) mod=ath9k_htc ;;
    0a12:0001|0bda:8771|0a5c:21e8) mod=btusb ;;
    *)
        log "dongle $vidpid nao reconhecido (ignorado)"
        exit 0
        ;;
esac

# Espera o modprobe concluir por ate 3 s (orcamento da secao 1.4).
modprobe "$mod" 2>/dev/null || { log "falha ao carregar $mod"; exit 0; }

waited=0
while [ "$waited" -lt "$DETECT_TIMEOUT_MS" ]; do
    if [ -e /sys/class/net/wlan0 ] || [ -e /sys/class/bluetooth/hci0 ]; then
        break
    fi
    usleep 100000 2>/dev/null || sleep 1
    waited=$((waited + 100))
done

log "dongle $vidpid -> $mod (${waited} ms)"
exit 0
